{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/tr/reviews/id1364983343"}, "name":{"label":"chimeaare"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-22T02:39:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.25.0"}, "id":{"label":"13984494275"}, "title":{"label":"premium"}, "content":{"label":"When my partner and I first downloaded the app, we had just added each other and were only starting to take a look around when a discount popped up. But how are we supposed to decide whether we want to go premium without properly exploring the app first? The discount period was very short. The app looks nice, funny, and entertaining. We might have subscribed right away, but because of this oversight, we’re now considering deleting it. It’s very poorly thought out.\n\nbc without the preimum there is nothing much to do in the app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/tr/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
